{"version":1,"content":"\n\n<h5><strong>Podcast</strong></h5>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>影像報道</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜蔡母張燕花五天供詞整合　蔡與鄺家如何鬧翻？辯方指出甚麼相反案情？</strong></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>上周焦點</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳案　蔡母、譚方駿、譚父完成作供　譚方駿：目睹鄺球粗言罵及衝向妻</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4B8g7S4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"譚方駿 集誌社 駁\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0291_03_content_01-copy-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a><figcaption>譚方駿周二（13 日）離開高院。（《法庭線》記者攝）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day17-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf%e6%8c%87%e8%a1%a8%e9%9d%a2%e4%b8%8a%e8%88%87%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba%e7%b6%ad%e6%8c%81%e9%97%9c%e4%bf%82-%e7%a2%ba%e8%aa%8d/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"譚父 譚澤均\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0297_01_content_01-copy-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a><figcaption>譚澤均周五（16 日）作供後離開高院。（《法庭線》記者攝）</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day14-%e8%94%a1%e6%af%8d%e5%ae%8c%e6%88%90%e4%bd%9c%e4%be%9b-%e5%90%a6%e8%aa%8d%e8%94%a1%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba%e5%8a%a9%e9%82%84%e8%b3%ad%e5%82%b5-%e5%ae%98/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day14｜蔡母否認蔡、鄺港智助還賭債　官指部分屬傳聞證供</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4B8g7S4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day15｜譚方駿：目睹鄺球粗言罵及衝向妻　妻為子女平等營造鄺家不錯假象</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4ijpkPU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day16｜譚方駿：事後回想感覺李瑞香想拖延報警　鄺港傑好似呃緊瞞緊我</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day17-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf%e6%8c%87%e8%a1%a8%e9%9d%a2%e4%b8%8a%e8%88%87%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba%e7%b6%ad%e6%8c%81%e9%97%9c%e4%bf%82-%e7%a2%ba%e8%aa%8d/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day17｜譚方駿指表面上與鄺港智維持關係　確認父就被追數找鄺球幫忙</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>王岸然案　錄影會面稱國安約談「賣晒報紙」　非立案調查毋須保密</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day2-%e9%8c%84%e5%bd%b1%e6%9c%83%e9%9d%a2%e7%a8%b1%e8%a2%ab%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%89%e7%b4%84%e8%ab%87%e6%97%a9%e5%b7%b2%e8%b3%a3%e6%99%92%e5%a0%b1%e7%b4%99-%e4%b8%8d/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王岸然案\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0287_03_link_02-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day2-%e9%8c%84%e5%bd%b1%e6%9c%83%e9%9d%a2%e7%a8%b1%e8%a2%ab%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%89%e7%b4%84%e8%ab%87%e6%97%a9%e5%b7%b2%e8%b3%a3%e6%99%92%e5%a0%b1%e7%b4%99-%e4%b8%8d/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day2｜錄影會面稱被國安約談早已「賣晒報紙」　認為非立案調查毋須保密</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day3-%e5%ba%ad%e4%b8%8a%e6%92%ad%e8%a2%ab%e6%8c%87%e7%85%bd%e5%8b%95%e5%bd%b1%e7%89%87-%e7%8e%8b%e8%ab%87%e5%8f%8a%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%89%e6%b3%95%e9%81%95%e4%ba%ba/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day3｜庭上播被指煽動影片　王談及《國安法》違人權、呼籲「軟對抗」</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>六旬婦涉住所門外貼光時揮春　煽動罪成判3個月醫院令</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4z3txNq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"六旬婦涉住所門外貼港英旗　煽動罪成判3個月住院令　官：意圖鼓勵同道中人革命\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0294_02_link_03-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zx8lPJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day1｜被告稱無能力煽動　31樓窗貼港英旗僅能「煽動雀仔」</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e5%85%ad%e6%97%ac%e5%a9%a6%e6%b6%89%e4%bd%8f%e6%89%80%e9%96%80%e5%a4%96%e8%b2%bc%e6%b8%af%e8%8b%b1%e6%97%97-%e7%a8%b1%e7%9b%bc%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e5%8a%a0%e5%85%a5%e8%8b%b1%e8%81%af%e9%82%a6-%e4%ba%ba/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day2｜被告稱盼香港加入英聯邦　「人人皆可有願望」</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4z3txNq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day3｜六旬婦煽動罪成判3個月住院令　官：意圖鼓勵同道中人革命</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>男子葵涌廣場與警爭執案　襲警罪脫、認擾亂秩序罰款　官質疑警員證供不一致</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yRg4Z2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"被告王志輝\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-15-03-1024x538.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>宏福苑聽證會｜前法團顧問陳球強：黃碧嬌遭政治打壓</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4hPKhSk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0296_05_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a><figcaption>法團顧問陳球強（前右一）（宏福苑業主立案法團網站）</figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>匡智會宿舍內5度強姦院友　助理舍監判囚13年　官：行為極度厭惡</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3TRoTmE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"匡智會宿舍內5度強姦院友　助理舍監判囚13年　官：行為令人極度厭惡\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-14-01-1024x538.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>父涉毆兩女兒被裁定3虐兒罪成　兩警調查時無檢查傷勢　官斥有違常理</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3VKZPhJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"九龍城法院\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DSC05627-2-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>食環職員涉執勤扯跌拾荒婦　普通襲擊罪脫　官：事主阻礙執法、被告行使合法武力</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zoaGwl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"被告李國成 事主林瑞琴\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0289_03_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>機電署督察涉欺詐遮仔會　辯方申押後　控方指停職9個月出半糧浪費公帑</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4sjvrr3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"羅俊洪\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/0230_02_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>醫生戴港盛免針紙案　控方結案稱僅一張免針紙欠醫療理據　足裁定有罪</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3WrnROR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"戴港盛周四離開區域法院（《法庭線》記者攝）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-15-01-1024x538.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>深圳能源環保提司法覆核　質疑中國建築涉致命事故無被罰停牌　仍投得百億元焚化爐項目</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4Bq8uqj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0296_01_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:58:42.391913+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":804,"images":12,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:54:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:02.843654+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:57:41.532194+00:00","content_hash":"6eb3de34e17d6e0f1d695870571420035df5